  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The villagers are treating me well but they are distant. They do not look
    at me like im a visitor, nor a friend. More like they want something that I have.
    \n[Theres like a picture of a symbol]\nI don\u2019t know what it means. I first
    time i saw it was in the Manager Room \n(There will be a mechanic added here later
    on)Interview Notes: There was a drought in this area a couple of years ago. But
    at the beginning of spring in the next year, it was said that someone had arrived
    to save them and strangely enough, it snowed. The village survived and ever since,
    they thrived. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
